# What stays out of the .vsix.
#
# The two bundles in `out/` are the extension; everything that produced them is not. Source maps are
# kept on disk for the Extension Development Host and are 3 MB of the package if they ship, which is
# most of it.
.vscodeignore
.gitignore
src/**
scripts/**
out/**/*.map
node_modules/**
**/*.vsix
